{
  "$comment": [
    "Clinical-safety golden corpus (CLAUDE.md §52).",
    "",
    "A FIXED set of scenarios that must fire / not fire IDENTICALLY across",
    "versions. This suite is a DEPLOYMENT GATE [RED LINE §52]: a PR that breaks it",
    "does not merge, regardless of who authored it or what else it fixes.",
    "",
    "Authored by the Clinical Governance Board. Adding or changing a scenario",
    "requires the clinical-safety-reviewer agent (§59).",
    "",
    "Each scenario declares:",
    "  answers           — the normalized answer view the engine sees",
    "  must_fire         — rule ids that MUST fire (a miss is a false negative)",
    "  must_not_fire     — rule ids that MUST NOT fire (a hit is a false positive)",
    "  expect_fast_path  — whether the AMPLE fast path must engage (§14)",
    "  expect_alert      — whether a nurse-facing alert must be created",
    "",
    "Edge cases are deliberately included: incomplete history, conflicting",
    "answers, and borderline severity — the three shapes most likely to break a",
    "rule silently."
  ],
  "protocol": { "family": "general_medicine", "version": "v1" },
  "ruleset": "emergency_v1",

  "scenarios": [
    {
      "id": "gold.acs.textbook",
      "description": "Classic ACS: crushing central chest pain radiating to the left arm, with cold sweating.",
      "answers": {
        "gm.cc.primary_complaint": { "code": "chest_pain" },
        "gm.hpi.site": { "codes": ["chest_center"] },
        "gm.hpi.character": { "codes": ["crushing"] },
        "gm.hpi.radiation": { "codes": ["left_arm"] },
        "gm.hpi.associated_symptoms": { "codes": ["cold_sweating", "breathlessness"] },
        "gm.hpi.severity": { "value": 9 },
        "gm.hpi.time_course": { "code": "sudden_and_severe" },
        "gm.hpi.exacerbating": { "codes": ["physical_exertion"] }
      },
      "must_fire": [
        "rf.acs.crushing_central_chest_pain",
        "rf.acs.chest_pain_with_radiation",
        "rf.acs.chest_pain_autonomic_features",
        "rf.pain.severe_uncontrolled",
        "rf.pain.sudden_severe_onset",
        "rf.cardiac.exertional_pattern"
      ],
      "must_not_fire": [
        "rf.stroke.fast_positive",
        "rf.gi.upper_or_lower_gi_bleed",
        "rf.aortic.tearing_pain"
      ],
      "expect_fast_path": true,
      "expect_alert": true
    },
